 \"\"\"Stamp a boolean mask onto grid at (r0, c0) using the given color.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/11dc524f.py:155:    \"\"\"Pick a random origin for the touching sprite+mirror pair.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/11dc524f.py:159:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/11dc524f.py:177:    \"\"\"Compute output and input placement params for a given side.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/11dc524f.py:181:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/11dc524f.py:214:    \"\"\"Try to build one valid (input, output) pair; return input or None.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/11dc524f.py:260:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6350f1f4.py:61:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6350f1f4.py:62:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6350f1f4.py:81:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6350f1f4.py:290:    \"\"\"Reserve enough evidence for the solver to infer every block and separator.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6350f1f4.py:360:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/faa9f03d.py:35:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/faa9f03d.py:36:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/faa9f03d.py:52:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/faa9f03d.py:422:    \"\"\"Build waypoint list for a random polyline with axis ax (0=vert-primary, 1=horiz-primary).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/faa9f03d.py:456:    \"\"\"Build L-shaped arm waypoints for _path_crossing_all / _path_through.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/faa9f03d.py:891:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/e729b7be.py:7:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/e729b7be.py:8:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/e729b7be.py:20:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/A